iptap-based notes in one workspace","comments":0,"category":"Showcase","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:24:09Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"v3.34.0","tag":"v3.34.0","published_at":"2026-11-13T13:20:57Z","body":"### @tiptap/ai-toolkit\n\n#### Minor Changes\n\n- `getEditorContext` now describes the charts and diagrams of `@tiptap-pro/extension-diagrams`, so the AI can read, add and change them.\n\n### @tiptap/core\n\n#### Patch Changes\n\n- Fix Backspace undo after automatic formatting when used with extensions such as UniqueID.\n- Correct `setContent` documentation\n\n### @tiptap/extension-blockquote\n\n#### Patch Changes\n\n- Keep the caret at the join when Backspace merges a paragraph into the blockquote above it.\n\n### @tiptap/extension-details\n\n#### Patch Changes\n\n- A Details node created open now stays open when its content changes right after it is created.\n\n### @tiptap/extension-drag-handle-react\n\n#### Patch Changes\n\n- Declare `@types/react` as an optional peer dependency so React types resolve under pnpm's global virtual store.\n\n### @tiptap/extension-find-and-replace\n\n#### Minor Changes\n\n- Added a `continuesNode` option. Textblocks it marks as continuing the textblock before them are searched as one text, so a phrase that runs from one into the next is found, highlighted and replaced.\n\n### @tiptap/static-renderer\n\n#### Patch Changes\n\n- Fix React type resolution when using pnpm’s global virtual store.","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}